      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.88,
      "end_seconds": 6.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Hi there, is it it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.32,
      "end_seconds": 11.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "yes, do sit tell me what's been happening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.39,
      "end_seconds": 17.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I've been dealing with stiffness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.31,
      "end_seconds": 24.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Roughly when did it start? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.6,
      "end_seconds": 29.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "It's been one week, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.03,
      "end_seconds": 34.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "have you found anything that eases it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.25,
      "end_seconds": 46.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.25,
      "text": "I get some relief from stretching. Oh, and difficulty bending forward. That's been about the same, five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.31,
      "end_seconds": 50.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "A few measurements, then we'll continue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.47,
      "end_seconds": 60.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Rest your hand here..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.97,
      "end_seconds": 82.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 18, blood pressure 108 over 80, heart rate 67."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.58,
      "end_seconds": 87.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "okay, a quick examination now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.57,
      "end_seconds": 91.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.37,
      "end_seconds": 112.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "There's tenderness over the muscles on the right of the lower back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.69,
      "end_seconds": 116.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Hold that that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.64,
      "end_seconds": 133.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "straight leg raise is negative on both sides and power in the legs is normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.0,
      "end_seconds": 141.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Right, you can sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.4,
      "end_seconds": 157.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "have you had any bladder problems, numbness in the legs or weakness in the legs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.26,
      "end_seconds": 162.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "no, you know, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.96,
      "end_seconds": 167.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.35,
      "end_seconds": 174.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "no, that's all normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.06,
      "end_seconds": 177.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.89,
      "end_seconds": 181.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.94,
      "end_seconds": 185.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.2,
      "end_seconds": 189.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "None, as far as I'm aware."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.73,
      "end_seconds": 197.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.34,
      "end_seconds": 201.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.84,
      "end_seconds": 215.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.92,
      "end_seconds": 217.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "I've never smoked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.09,
      "end_seconds": 220.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Who's at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.4,
      "end_seconds": 227.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "It's just me and my wife at home now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.72,
      "end_seconds": 229.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "How's your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.55,
      "end_seconds": 231.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "I'm mostly vegetarian"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.06,
      "end_seconds": 235.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "are you working at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.55,
      "end_seconds": 240.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Yes, I'm a nurse on a busy ward"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.41,
      "end_seconds": 244.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.47,
      "end_seconds": 255.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "I, I take Volini gel, twice a day. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.34,
      "end_seconds": 273.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "putting it all together, I'd lean towards mechanical low back pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.88,
      "end_seconds": 277.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Right, is this something I'll have for good?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.08,
      "end_seconds": 287.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's mechanical low back pain, and we'll watch how it goes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.82,
      "end_seconds": 313.35,
      "duration_seconds": 18.53,
      "text": "every hour, get up and stretch if you're at a desk the thing that would worry me is if you get numbness in the groin or lose bladder control if that happens, go to emergency right, that's all go gently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.37,
      "end_seconds": 319.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.69,
      "end_seconds": 322.45,
